21	%% ----------------------------------------
22	%% *** Intended for ACL conferences ***
23	%% 
24	%% Copyright 1994-2011 Patrick W Daly
25	 % ===============================================================
26	 % IMPORTANT NOTICE:
27	 % This bibliographic style (bst) file has been generated from one or
28	 % more master bibliographic style (mbs) files, listed above.
